* passive invert h1y -> h1yn: R2/R1=1.0000200002 closed-loop -1 at A=100000
Rinvh1ia h1y invh1m 10000
Rinvh1ib h1yn invh1m 10000.200002
Einvh1amp h1yn 0 0 invh1m 100000
